<title>NORWAY: Nycomed, Statoil in plant JV.</title>
<headline>Nycomed, Statoil in plant JV.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nycomed ASA said on Thursday it would jointly invest with state oil company Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) between 200 and 300 million crowns to build a bioprotein plant at Tjeldbergodden on the west coast of Norway.</p>
</text>
